{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "gsm-system-2-1-contract",
    "name": "gsm-system 2.1 / 2.1 API",
    "description": "The /api/v1-only contract. A new preset store contains editable defaults \"0\" through \"4\". Read requests run by default. Preset CRUD persists data but never starts a cell. The CRUD fixture uses the separate lab-900 ID and never edits/deletes a default. Every mutation is guarded by enable_mutations; cell starts additionally require enable_rf_start=true and have no automatic RF tests. HTTP 202 for SMS means submitted, never delivered. Replace placeholders; do not save real IMSIs, numbers, tokens, or hosts. network names the container interface (default bridge: eth0), not a host NIC.\n\n仅包含 /api/v1。新预设库包含 ID \"0\" 至 \"4\" 的五套可编辑默认配置；CRUD 夹具使用独立 lab-900，不会修改或删除默认项。所有写操作需 enable_mutations；启动小区还需 enable_rf_start=true，且不自动执行 RF 测试。\nExact factory-value assertions are opt-in with verify_factory_defaults=true; normal reads validate only resource structure and the selected default_preset_id. / 精确工厂值断言仅在 verify_factory_defaults=true 时执行；常规读取只校验结构和所选 ID。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8082",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "enable_mutations",
      "value": "false",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "imsi",
      "value": "001010000000000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "number",
      "value": "10000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "iface",
      "value": "eth0",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "c0",
      "value": "540",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "mcc",
      "value": "001",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "mnc",
      "value": "01",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "lac",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "ci",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "preset_id",
      "value": "lab-900",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "preset_name",
      "value": "Lab 900",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "preset_description",
      "value": "Indoor fixture",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "enable_rf_start",
      "value": "false",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "default_preset_id",
      "value": "0",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "verify_factory_defaults",
      "value": "false",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "const token = String(pm.environment.get('token') || pm.collectionVariables.get('token') || '').trim();",
          "pm.request.headers.remove('Authorization');",
          "if (token) pm.request.headers.add({key: 'Authorization', value: 'Bearer ' + token});"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "pm.test('response is a JSON envelope / JSON 包络', function () {",
          "  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Content-Type')).to.include('application/json');",
          "  const body = pm.response.json();",
          "  pm.expect(body).to.have.property('code').that.is.a('number');",
          "  pm.expect(body).to.have.property('message').that.is.a('string');",
          "  pm.expect(body).to.have.property('request_id').that.is.a('string').and.not.empty;",
          "  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('X-Request-ID')).to.eql(body.request_id);",
          "});"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Read-only / 默认只读",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /api/v1/health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health",
            "description": "Control-plane health, version/revision, cell state; not RF acceptance. / 管理面健康，不是射频验收。"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200 stopped health', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); const d=pm.response.json().data; pm.expect(d.ok).to.eql(true); pm.expect(d.version).to.eql('2.1.0'); pm.expect(d.cell.state).to.eql('stopped'); pm.expect(d.cell.ready).to.eql(false); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /api/v1/cell",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cell",
            "description": "state=stopped|transitioning|degraded|running; ready means five processes only."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200 stopped process snapshot', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); const d=pm.response.json().data; pm.expect(d.state).to.eql('stopped'); pm.expect(d.ready).to.eql(false); pm.expect(d.sms_ready).to.eql(false); pm.expect(d.voice_ready).to.eql(false); pm.expect(d.running).to.eql(false); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /api/v1/profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profile"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200 no saved profile', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); const d=pm.response.json().data; pm.expect(d.has_profile).to.eql(false); pm.expect(d).not.to.have.property('profile'); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /api/v1/config",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/config"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200: seeded OpenBTS DB exists', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('config is a non-empty key/value array', function () { const a=pm.response.json().data.config; pm.expect(a).to.be.an('array').that.is.not.empty; pm.expect(a[0].key).to.be.a('string'); pm.expect(a[0].value).to.be.a('string'); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /api/v1/connections",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/connections?limit=100&offset=0",
            "description": "Volatile observation, not an online assertion. / 易失观察，不是在线判定。"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 412: cell is intentionally stopped', () => pm.response.to.have.status(412));",
                  "pm.test('precondition code', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql(41201));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /api/v1/subscribers",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/subscribers?limit=100&offset=0"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200: seeded registry DB exists', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('clean registry is an empty paginated snapshot', function () { const d=pm.response.json().data; pm.expect(d.subscribers).to.eql([]); pm.expect(d.count).to.eql(0); pm.expect(d.total).to.eql(0); pm.expect(d.limit).to.eql(100); pm.expect(d.offset).to.eql(0); pm.expect(d.source).to.eql('asterisk_registry'); pm.expect(d.window).to.eql('full'); pm.expect(d.truncated).to.eql(false); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /api/v1/subscribers/{imsi}",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/subscribers/{{imsi}}",
            "description": "Replace IMSI placeholder with a 15-digit dedicated test IMSI."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 404: example IMSI is absent from clean seed', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));",
                  "pm.test('not-found code', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql(40401));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /api/v1/sms",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sms?limit=100&offset=0"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 404: no smqueue log before cell activity', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));",
                  "pm.test('not-found code', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql(40401));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /api/v1/calls",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/calls?limit=100&offset=0",
            "description": "Active Asterisk channels, not a lifetime call count. bridge_id is a bridge UUID, not a channel name."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 412: Asterisk is intentionally stopped', () => pm.response.to.have.status(412));",
                  "pm.test('precondition code', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql(41201));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /api/v1/calls/history",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/calls/history?limit=100&offset=0",
            "description": "Real 18-column Asterisk CSV CDR with RFC3339 UTC timestamps; no synthetic history."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 404: no CDR before calls', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));",
                  "pm.test('not-found code', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql(40401));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /api/v1/network",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/network?iface={{iface}}"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 503: isolated container has no iptables capability', () => pm.response.to.have.status(503));",
                  "pm.test('native dependency code', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql(50301));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /api/v1/presets",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/presets",
            "description": "Returns the sorted current collection. Normal tests validate structure only; set verify_factory_defaults=true only against a fresh/unmodified store. / 返回当前有序列表；常规仅校验结构，仅对全新未修改预设库开启精确工厂断言。"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200 preset collection', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('preset list structure', function () { const items=pm.response.json().data.items; pm.expect(items).to.be.an('array'); items.forEach(function (p) { pm.expect(p).to.have.all.keys('id','name','description','params'); pm.expect(p.id).to.be.a('string'); pm.expect(p.params).to.have.all.keys('arfcns','c0','band','mcc','mnc','lac','ci','short_name','network'); }); });",
                  "if (String(pm.environment.get('verify_factory_defaults') || pm.collectionVariables.get('verify_factory_defaults')).toLowerCase() === 'true') {",
                  "  pm.test('fresh store has exact factory defaults', function () { const expected=[{\"id\":\"0\",\"name\":\"addx\",\"description\":\"\",\"params\":{\"arfcns\":\"1\",\"c0\":\"540\",\"band\":\"1800\",\"mcc\":\"001\",\"mnc\":\"01\",\"lac\":\"1\",\"ci\":\"1\",\"short_name\":\"addx\",\"network\":\"eth0\"}},{\"id\":\"1\",\"name\":\"ChinaMobile\",\"description\":\"\",\"params\":{\"arfcns\":\"1\",\"c0\":\"55\",\"band\":\"900\",\"mcc\":\"460\",\"mnc\":\"00\",\"lac\":\"1\",\"ci\":\"1\",\"short_name\":\"ChinaMobile\",\"network\":\"eth0\"}},{\"id\":\"2\",\"name\":\"ChinaMobile\",\"description\":\"\",\"params\":{\"arfcns\":\"1\",\"c0\":\"540\",\"band\":\"1800\",\"mcc\":\"460\",\"mnc\":\"00\",\"lac\":\"1\",\"ci\":\"1\",\"short_name\":\"ChinaMobile\",\"network\":\"eth0\"}},{\"id\":\"3\",\"name\":\"ChinaUnicom\",\"description\":\"\",\"params\":{\"arfcns\":\"1\",\"c0\":\"70\",\"band\":\"900\",\"mcc\":\"460\",\"mnc\":\"01\",\"lac\":\"1\",\"ci\":\"1\",\"short_name\":\"ChinaUnicom\",\"network\":\"eth0\"}},{\"id\":\"4\",\"name\":\"ChinaUnicom\",\"description\":\"\",\"params\":{\"arfcns\":\"1\",\"c0\":\"668\",\"band\":\"1800\",\"mcc\":\"460\",\"mnc\":\"01\",\"lac\":\"1\",\"ci\":\"1\",\"short_name\":\"ChinaUnicom\",\"network\":\"eth0\"}}]; pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.items).to.eql(expected); });",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /api/v1/presets/{default_preset_id}",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/presets/{{default_preset_id}}",
            "description": "Reads the preset selected by default_preset_id without modifying it. Exact ID 0 factory fields are checked only when verify_factory_defaults=true. / 按变量只读预设；精确 ID0 工厂值仅在显式开关开启时校验。"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200 selected default preset', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('selected preset ID and structure', function () { const p=pm.response.json().data; pm.expect(p.id).to.eql(pm.variables.replaceIn('{{default_preset_id}}')); pm.expect(p).to.have.all.keys('id','name','description','params'); });",
                  "if (String(pm.environment.get('verify_factory_defaults') || pm.collectionVariables.get('verify_factory_defaults')).toLowerCase() === 'true') {",
                  "  pm.test('factory default 0 exact fixture', function () { pm.expect(pm.variables.replaceIn('{{default_preset_id}}')).to.eql('0'); const p=pm.response.json().data; pm.expect(p).to.eql({\"id\":\"0\",\"name\":\"addx\",\"description\":\"\",\"params\":{\"arfcns\":\"1\",\"c0\":\"540\",\"band\":\"1800\",\"mcc\":\"001\",\"mnc\":\"01\",\"lac\":\"1\",\"ci\":\"1\",\"short_name\":\"addx\",\"network\":\"eth0\"}}); });",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /api/v1/presets/{id}",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/presets/{{preset_id}}",
            "description": "The independent lab-900 CRUD fixture is absent before guarded creation. Defaults are not targeted. / 独立 lab-900 夹具创建前不存在，不操作默认项。"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 404 before fixture creation', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));",
                  "pm.test('not-found code', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().code).to.eql(40401));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Mutations (guarded) / 写操作（默认跳过）",
      "description": "Every request in this folder skips unless enable_mutations is exactly true. / 每个请求均有独立保护。",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /api/v1/cell",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (String(pm.environment.get('enable_mutations') || pm.collectionVariables.get('enable_mutations')).toLowerCase() !== 'true') pm.execution.skipRequest();",
                  "if (String(pm.environment.get('enable_rf_start') || pm.collectionVariables.get('enable_rf_start')).toLowerCase() !== 'true') pm.execution.skipRequest();"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"arfcns\": \"1\",\n  \"c0\": \"{{c0}}\",\n  \"band\": \"1800\",\n  \"mcc\": \"{{mcc}}\",\n  \"mnc\": \"{{mnc}}\",\n  \"lac\": \"{{lac}}\",\n  \"ci\": \"{{ci}}\",\n  \"short_name\": \"LAB\",\n  \"network\": \"{{iface}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cell",
            "description": "WARNING: starts the radio/cell stack. Run manually only after setting both enable_mutations=true and enable_rf_start=true; the collection performs no automatic RF assertion. network is the container interface (default bridge: eth0), not a host NIC. / 警告：会启动射频；需双重显式开关，集合不自动执行 RF 验收。network 是容器内网卡。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /api/v1/presets",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (String(pm.environment.get('enable_mutations') || pm.collectionVariables.get('enable_mutations')).toLowerCase() !== 'true') pm.execution.skipRequest();"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 201 preset created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.test('Location and object', function () { const id=pm.variables.replaceIn('{{preset_id}}'); pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Location')).to.eql('/api/v1/presets/'+id); pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.id).to.eql(id); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"id\": \"{{preset_id}}\",\n  \"name\": \"{{preset_name}}\",\n  \"description\": \"{{preset_description}}\",\n  \"params\": {\n    \"arfcns\": \"1\",\n    \"c0\": \"55\",\n    \"band\": \"900\",\n    \"mcc\": \"001\",\n    \"mnc\": \"01\",\n    \"lac\": \"1\",\n    \"ci\": \"1\",\n    \"short_name\": \"LAB\",\n    \"network\": \"{{iface}}\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/presets",
            "description": "Persists data only; does not start or reconfigure the cell. / 仅持久化，不启动或重配小区。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT /api/v1/presets/{id}",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (String(pm.environment.get('enable_mutations') || pm.collectionVariables.get('enable_mutations')).toLowerCase() !== 'true') pm.execution.skipRequest();"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200 preset updated', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('path ID remains stable', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.id).to.eql(pm.variables.replaceIn('{{preset_id}}')));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"{{preset_name}} updated\",\n  \"description\": \"{{preset_description}} updated\",\n  \"params\": {\n    \"arfcns\": \"1\",\n    \"c0\": \"60\",\n    \"band\": \"900\",\n    \"mcc\": \"001\",\n    \"mnc\": \"01\",\n    \"lac\": \"1\",\n    \"ci\": \"1\",\n    \"short_name\": \"LAB\",\n    \"network\": \"{{iface}}\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/presets/{{preset_id}}",
            "description": "Replaces name, description, and complete params only; body id is not accepted. / 仅替换名称、说明和完整参数。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /api/v1/cell from default preset (manual RF side effect)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (String(pm.environment.get('enable_mutations') || pm.collectionVariables.get('enable_mutations')).toLowerCase() !== 'true') pm.execution.skipRequest();",
                  "if (String(pm.environment.get('enable_rf_start') || pm.collectionVariables.get('enable_rf_start')).toLowerCase() !== 'true') pm.execution.skipRequest();"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"preset_id\": \"{{default_preset_id}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cell",
            "description": "WARNING: explicitly starts RF from default preset 0. This request never edits/deletes the default. Run manually only after validating band/channel and setting enable_mutations=true plus enable_rf_start=true. There are no automatic RF tests. / 警告：按默认预设 0 显式启动射频，不修改/删除默认项；需确认频段并开启双重开关，不含自动 RF 测试。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE /api/v1/presets/{id}",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (String(pm.environment.get('enable_mutations') || pm.collectionVariables.get('enable_mutations')).toLowerCase() !== 'true') pm.execution.skipRequest();"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
